-- a binding claim transports along identity of oriented molecules, carrying its event, its warrant
-- and the proof that the measurement was of this molecule. The transport is along the path, so a
-- collision of digests licenses nothing (collision-not-injective) and a relation that does not
-- compose licenses nothing (non-transitive-not-identity). Every inference the pharmacology record
-- makes from one molecule to another is one of these three, and only this one holds.
bind-transport : (b : BindClaim) → (T : Oriented) → bind-or b ≡ T → BindClaim
bind-transport b T q = (T , bind-prot b , bind-meas b , concat (bind-about b) (cong or-mol q))
